  <item>
    <title>《热烈》：平行宇宙之杭州2022</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c6a041e8176c3ff81385c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64c6a041e8176c3ff81385c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 31 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，本期节目聊了聊大鹏导演，黄渤、王一博主演的新片《热烈》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目邀请到了一位新嘉宾兜兜，他目前在一家影院做放映，希望能给大家带来一些不一样的视角。也欢迎大家在评论区和我们讨论你对这部影片的看法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a>影片基本信息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a>《热烈》影片背景信息；兜兜以杭州人的视角如何看待片中对杭州的呈现？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="276">04:36</a>正式开始影片评价，涉及对背景设定“2022杭州”的吐槽&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a>其实大鹏导演拍的是一部科幻片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 对影片表面剧情（A故事）的分析，剧情结构学春晚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a>所有人物都没有前史是《热烈》剧情最大的漏洞。黄渤成为本片的“爹”，陈烁没有人物弧光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a>剧情废线太多，人物没有作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a>分析立意（B故事），“一直努力就能成功”是对本片莫大的讽刺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a>如何评价片中黄渤和王一博的表演？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a>大鹏前作回顾，分析其创作习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：普林斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：兜兜</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目中主要提及的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span>《周六夜狂热》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《吉祥如意》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《保你平安》</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目中使用到的音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>《热烈》预告片</span></p><span></span><p><span>Flying Steps,Engelhardt,Wittig - We Are Electric</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hans Zimmer - Cornfield Chase</span></p><span></span><p><span>Head Automatica - Brooklyn Is Burning</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq2oZSvyQsOzCkwJmCWvAu850Ssa.m4a" length="41030492" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:16</itunes:duration>
